Hermit

Hairspring's process backend runs programs under Hermit
(https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit, BSD-3-Clause upstream). Hermit is a
separate program that the user installs and that Hairspring invokes as an
external command. No Hermit source code is included in this repository or in
Hairspring's binaries. The helper script experiments/linux-hermit-fork.sh
clones it from the upstream repository at run time.
